BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260424T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T000000
DTSTAMP:20260424T230721
CREATED:20260331T174004Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260422T113956Z
UID:10054042-1777064400-1777075200@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Jazz Appreciation Month: Roots and Dore Band | The Palm Room
DESCRIPTION:ALL THAT JAZZ… with a twist 🎶 This Friday\, April 24th in The Palm Room speakeasy\, our month-long jazz celebration takes a turn… It’s time for some late night BLUES 🥃 \nWe’re bringing in Roots and Dore Band\, a blues\, roots\, and soul experience straight out of AVL. Known for their raw\, captivating sound\, they blend original music with timeless covers inspired by the legends of blues and soul. It’s authentic and built to move you. \n🕗 Doors: 8 PM\n🎸 Band: 9 PM \n  \n$10 covers both the Showroom and Palm Room music. \nFitz\, she’s the party. Wolfe\, he’s the epicure. 2 levels\, 3 vibes. 🎶 Live Music |🍸Sips & Noms 🥪 | 🕹️ Artcade | 🗝️Speakeasy | Private Events \nFitz and the Wolfe is a cocktail and music venue shaped by the spirit of improvisation\, storytelling\, and the kind of nights that feel too good to end. Here\, every night brings a new soundtrack. Jazz\, swing\, honky-tonk\, and sometimes things a little more esoteric—if it moves people\, we book it. The music fills the space like a second heartbeat\, sometimes rowdy\, sometimes intimate\, always memorable. It’s not background noise. It’s the reason you’re here. fitzandthewolfe.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/fitz-wolf-template-2/
LOCATION:Fitz and the Wolfe\, 1 Battery Park Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/670898817_1129625760224392_1025302575205249966_n-e1776857985615.jpg
GEO:35.5954515;-82.5548502
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Fitz and the Wolfe 1 Battery Park Ave Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1 Battery Park Ave:geo:-82.5548502,35.5954515
END:VEVENT
