SUMMARY:Grove Arcade in Bloom ft. Steve Okonski
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday\, April 25 from 12-4pm for our third annual Grove Arcade in Bloom event\, a free community event. The Grove Arcade will transform into a botanical wonderland to welcome the changing of the seasons. This year’s lineup is bigger\, brighter\, and better than ever!\nWe are thrilled to announce our talented musical guest this year – founding and current member of Durand Jones and The Indications and Asheville local\, Steve Okonski!\nThe event will also feature: Performances by Stewart/Owen Dance Immersive botanical experience and plant market by Ross Farm Springtime makers market with the Southern Highland Craft Guild Beautiful floral displays and pop-up shop by Studio Flora Diva\, Inc. Tree giveaways every hour with our nonprofit partner Asheville GreenWorks Aperol Spritz bar pop-up bar to benefit Asheville GreenWorks Paper flower bouquets from Open Hearts Art Center Face painting and kids crafts Performance art all afternoon
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/grove-arcade-in-bloom-ft-steve-okonski/
LOCATION:The Grove Arcade
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,DJ/Electronic,Live Music
END:VEVENT
